    "result_text": "The full test suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, all tests pass). The project's surefire configuration runs the `AcceptanceTest`, which now passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe create audit line in `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner` now logs `membershipNumber` in addition to the fields it already recorded (`id`, `customerCode`, `registrationDate`, `membershipLevel`):\n\n```java\nAUDIT.info(\"Owner created: id={} customerCode={} registrationDate={} membershipLevel={} membershipNumber={}\",\n    owner.getId(), owner.getCustomerCode(), owner.getRegistrationDate(),\n    ownerMapper.membershipLevel(owner), ownerMapper.membershipNumber(owner));\n```\n\nVerified in the run output \u2014 the emitted line now reads e.g. `Owner created: id=11 customerCode=NSW-16E6609E registrationDate=2026-09-07 membershipLevel=2 membershipNumber=NSW-16E6609E-M26`, and `AcceptanceTest.coreAuditIncludesLevelAndNumber` passes.",
